---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import referenceImage from '../assets/images/curved-architecture.jpg';
import watercolor from '../assets/images/extension-watercolor-rose.webp';
---

<section class="browser-extension-scene" aria-labelledby="extension-title" data-header-surface="canvas">
	<div class="browser-extension-stage">
	<div class="browser-extension page-width" style={`--extension-art: url('${watercolor.src}')`}>
	<div class="browser-extension__copy">
		<div class="browser-extension__eyebrow"><span>Browser extension</span><span class="coming-soon-pill">Coming soon</span></div>
		<h2 id="extension-title">Save as you browse.</h2>
		<p>Bring pages, images, colors, and more from the web into Mnemee, right when you find them.</p>
		<div class="browser-extension__platform"><span class="browser-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="#fbbc04"/><path d="M12 12 6.5 21.5A11 11 0 0 1 2.5 6.5h6.3z" fill="#34a853"/><path d="M12 12 6.5 2.5A11 11 0 0 1 22.7 9H10.4z" fill="#ea4335"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.3" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" fill="#4285f4"/></svg>Chrome</span><span class="browser-badge"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/main/browser/branding/official/content/about-logo.svg" alt="" />Firefox</span></div>
	</div>
	<div class="browser-extension__visual" role="img" aria-label="Concept preview of saving a page with the Mnemee browser extension">
		<div class="browser-window" aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="browser-window__bar"><span class="browser-window__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="browser-window__address">atelier.example/journal/studies-in-light</span><span class="browser-window__mark"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" /></span></div>
			<div class="browser-window__page"><div class="browser-page__nav"><strong>atlr</strong><span>Stories&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Spaces&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Index</span></div><div class="browser-page__heading"><span>SPACES &nbsp; / &nbsp; ARCHITECTURE</span><strong>Inside the concrete stairwell</strong></div><Image src={referenceImage} width={900} densities={[1, 2]} quality={76} alt="" /><div class="browser-page__body"><p>A simple stair, shaped by concrete and daylight. Its curves soften the space as the light changes throughout the day, drawing the eye gently upward. A soft wash of daylight traces the curve from one floor to the next.</p><p>The surface carries the marks of its making, while a narrow opening brings a quiet rhythm to the climb. At each landing, the changing light reveals a different texture in the walls.</p><h3>Form in the details</h3><p>Here, the handrail follows the wall rather than interrupting it. Each turn reveals another view of the space, balancing the weight of the concrete with a sense of openness.</p><p>It is a small moment of transition, carefully considered: a place to slow down and notice the materials around you. The restrained palette lets the shifting light become part of the architecture.</p></div></div>
			<div class="extension-preview">
				<div class="extension-preview__top"><img src="/mnemee-logo.svg" alt="" /></div>
				<div class="extension-preview__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16l-6-4z"/><path d="M12 7v6m-3-3h6"/></svg></div>
				<strong class="extension-preview__title">Save this page</strong>
				<p>Add the page you're viewing to your Mnemee Inbox and keep it close.</p>
				<div class="extension-preview__save"><span class="extension-preview__save-default">Save to Inbox</span><span class="extension-preview__save-done">✓&nbsp; Saved to Inbox</span></div>
				<div class="extension-preview__color"><span><strong>Pick a color</strong><small>Sample a color from the page.</small></span><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m2 22 1-4 9-9 3 3-9 9-4 1Z"/><path d="m11 8 5-5a3 3 0 0 1 4 4l-5 5M10 7l7 7"/></svg></i></div>
			</div>
			<svg class="extension-preview__cursor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3.2v15.6l4.2-4 2.8 6.3 2.6-1.1-2.8-6.2h5.9z" /></svg>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div>
	</div>
</section>

<script>
	import '../scripts/browser-extension';
</script>

<style>
	.browser-extension-scene { margin-top: var(--section-gap); }
	/* The centered sticky stage adds space above the panel; count that toward the section gap. */
	.browser-extension-scene[data-active] { margin-top: max(0px, calc(var(--section-gap) - var(--extension-inset))); }
	.browser-extension-scene[data-active] { height: calc(100svh - 84px + 115svh); }
	.browser-extension-scene[data-active] .browser-extension-stage { position: sticky; top: 68px; display: flex; align-items: center; height: calc(100svh - 84px); }
	.browser-extension { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 44px); align-items: center; overflow: hidden; padding: clamp(36px, 5vw, 68px) 0 0 clamp(32px, 5vw, 68px); border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(165deg, rgb(183 111 110 / 22%), rgb(125 66 76 / 30%)), var(--extension-art) center / cover; background-blend-mode: multiply, normal; }
	.browser-extension::after { content: ''; position: absolute; z-index: 4; inset: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: inherit; pointer-events: none; }
	.browser-extension__copy { --ink: #201b19; --ink-muted: #5e514c; --surface: #fff9f3; --line: rgb(58 35 25 / 16%); max-width: 500px; padding: 0 0 clamp(36px, 5vw, 68px); color: var(--ink); }
	.browser-extension__eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .035em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	h2 { max-width: 16ch; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 60px); font-weight: 560; letter-spacing: -.048em; line-height: 1.02; text-wrap: balance; }
	.browser-extension__copy p { max-width: 44ch; margin: 22px 0 0; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.6; text-wrap: pretty; }
	.browser-extension__platform { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 28px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }.browser-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 6px 9px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); font-size: 11px; }.browser-badge svg, .browser-badge img { width: 15px; height: 15px; }
	.browser-extension__visual { --surface: #fff; --surface-muted: #f7f7f7; --canvas: #fafafa; --ink: #151515; --ink-muted: #656562; --line: #deded9; --line-strong: #c7c7c1; min-width: 0; height: 390px; align-self: end; }
	.browser-extension-scene[data-active] .browser-extension__visual { align-self: center; }
	.browser-window { position: relative; height: 700px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-right: 0; border-radius: 9px 0 0 9px; background: var(--canvas); box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgb(81 43 25 / 16%); }
	.browser-window__bar { display: flex; height: 40px; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 0 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
	.browser-window__dots { display: flex; gap: 4px; }.browser-window__dots i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--line-strong); }
	.browser-window__address { flex: 1; overflow: hidden; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--surface-muted); color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 9px; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
	.browser-window__mark { display: grid; width: 23px; height: 23px; flex-shrink: 0; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 5px; background: var(--surface-muted); }.browser-window__mark img { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
	.browser-window__page { position: absolute; inset: 40px 0 0; overflow: hidden; background: #f4f3ef; color: #272722; }.browser-window__page > img { display: block; width: calc(100% - 56px); height: 230px; margin: 0 28px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 46%; }.browser-page__nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 11px 28px; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .04em; }.browser-page__nav strong { color: #77776f; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1; }.browser-page__heading { display: grid; gap: 7px; padding: 22px 28px 18px; }.browser-page__heading span { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .08em; }.browser-page__heading strong { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.3vw, 30px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1.04; }.browser-page__body { padding: 18px 28px 28px; }.browser-page__body p { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #77776f; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.55; }.browser-page__body h3 { margin: 18px 0 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
	.extension-preview { position: absolute; z-index: 2; top: 48px; right: 14px; width: min(230px, 55%); padding: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgb(0 0 0 / 18%); }
	.extension-preview__top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; }.extension-preview__top img { width: 64px; }.extension-preview__top span { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 7px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .04em; }
	.extension-preview__icon { display: grid; width: 29px; height: 29px; margin-top: 22px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--surface-muted); }.extension-preview__icon svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
	.extension-preview__title { display: block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.02em; }.extension-preview p { margin: 5px 0 12px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; }
	.extension-preview__save { position: relative; display: grid; height: 29px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #0e0e0e; border-radius: 6px; background: linear-gradient(#373737, #171717); color: #fafafa; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; }
	.extension-preview__save-default, .extension-preview__save-done { grid-area: 1 / 1; }.extension-preview__save-done { opacity: 0; }.extension-preview__cursor { position: absolute; z-index: 3; top: 0; left: 0; width: 20px; height: 20px; overflow: visible; fill: #111; stroke: white; stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-linejoin: round; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transform-origin: 4px 3px; }
	.extension-preview__color { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 5px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }.extension-preview__color strong, .extension-preview__color small { display: block; }.extension-preview__color strong { font-size: 10px; }.extension-preview__color small { margin-top: 3px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 8px; }.extension-preview__color i { display: grid; width: 25px; height: 25px; flex-shrink: 0; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 5px; }.extension-preview__color i svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .browser-extension { background-image: linear-gradient(160deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 12%), transparent 55%, rgb(73 35 45 / 10%)), var(--extension-art); background-blend-mode: normal; }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .browser-badge { background: #262626; border-color: #454545; color: #f1f3ee; }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .browser-extension__visual { --surface: oklch(.145 0 0); --surface-muted: oklch(.269 0 0); --canvas: oklch(.205 0 0); --ink: #f1f3ee; --ink-muted: #a7aca4; --line: oklch(1 0 0 / 10%); --line-strong: oklch(1 0 0 / 15%); }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .browser-window__page { background: #20201e; color: #f1f0eb; }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .browser-page__nav strong, :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .browser-page__body p { color: #aaa9a1; }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .extension-preview__top img { filter: invert(1); }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .extension-preview__save { border-color: #c9c9c9; background: linear-gradient(#fff, #e5e5e5); color: #171717; }
	@media (max-width: 820px) { .browser-extension { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; background-position: center; }.browser-extension__copy { padding: 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 68px) 0 0; }.browser-extension__visual { height: 390px; margin-left: clamp(16px, 5vw, 48px); }.browser-window { height: 660px; } }
	@media (max-width: 520px) { .browser-extension { padding: 32px 0 0 24px; gap: 30px; }.browser-extension__visual { height: 330px; margin-left: 16px; }.browser-window { height: 620px; }.browser-page__nav, .browser-page__heading, .browser-page__body { padding-left: 18px; padding-right: 18px; }.browser-window__page > img { width: calc(100% - 36px); height: 170px; margin-inline: 18px; }.extension-preview { right: 8px; width: min(210px, 62%); padding: 12px; } }
</style>
